The class/module schema in _schema.py is generated by runtime/packaging/build-plotly-client-package.py. Do not edit it by hand. The facade lazily creates graph_objs classes from that schema; _cls_overrides.py supplies the handwritten behavior.

The generator's Python version selects upstream templates. The exact plotly.js dependency in runtime/client/package.json selects the JavaScript schema and renderer; keep it matched to that Python reference version. Run pnpm install before generating. The Plot component dynamically imports the installed package's prebuilt renderer; the bundler emits it as a separate chunk loaded on first use. These pins do not install or upgrade the Plotly Python package on Downlinks or Uplinks.

Legacy Mapbox classes retain their original portable identities for existing apps and older servers. The Plot component translates a rendering copy to modern map traces; the Python objects remain unchanged.
